# Title: Renamed CreateDump Utility Execution
# ID: 1a1ed54a-2ba4-4221-94d5-01dee560d71e
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-09-20
# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1036, attack.t1003.001, attack.credential-access
# Description: Detects uses of a renamed legitimate createdump.exe LOLOBIN utility to dump process memory
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((((CommandLine CONTAIN " -u " AND CommandLine CONTAIN " -f " AND CommandLine CONTAIN ".dmp")) OR ((CommandLine CONTAIN " --full " AND CommandLine CONTAIN " --name " AND CommandLine CONTAIN ".dmp"))) OR (OriginalFileName = "FX_VER_INTERNALNAME_STR")) AND NOT ((Image="*\\createdump.exe")))
